{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9001_p", "source_sha256": "0919bfad9ecf180d80a247148c669a01865efb5f61ed77be897f77f52eaafcc4", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影。\n茜のテーマは『一途系女子』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄。\n茜的主题是“专情系女子”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9002_023aka", "source_sha256": "e517795c8e1b1dfe8d10918cefc4f9d01d0366326803054b599277f896c26f44", "ja": "こんなに破壊力の高いテーマを茜ちゃんに与えるとは、\n{$P$}ちゃんてば、容赦がないね～。", "zh": "居然把杀伤力这么强的主题交给小茜，{$P$}还真是毫不留情啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9003_023aka", "source_sha256": "06fc7266dd2346030da6ef059e813d882fe5e79095c946910a7d0aff29c4f6f4", "ja": "カワイイ茜ちゃんに一途に思われて、尽くされたら\n茜ちゃんガチ恋勢を量産しちゃわないかニャ？", "zh": "要是被可爱的小茜一心一意地喜欢着，还被照顾得无微不至的话，岂不是会让小茜的真爱粉大量增加吗，喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9004_p", "source_sha256": "dd48fc4cc1fb1f779610721098688c9ffdd73ccf20e94fff99cbcbefb5985a53", "ja": "ん？　それでいいと思うよ。テーマとしても、\nそういう、あざとい感じは茜にピッタリだと思って。", "zh": "嗯？我觉得那样挺好的啊。作为主题来说，\n我也觉得那种耍小聪明装可爱般的感觉很适合茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9005_023aka", "source_sha256": "4c6b57b43256932c609728c22abb77eb36aabd3b4abae925cd560c30a31f569d", "ja": "あざとい……？　{$P$}ちゃんは……\nいつも茜ちゃんのことを、そんな風に思ってたの？", "zh": "刻意卖萌……？{$P$}，你一直都是那样看待小茜的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9006_p", "source_sha256": "ace41921ddbd3e1dfac369058b8467da62a718dc4db7eb8b6dea13382121febe", "ja": "えっ？　ち、違っ……今の話は撮影の話で……。", "zh": "诶？不、不是……刚才说的是拍摄的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9007_023aka", "source_sha256": "efa5cc72d7881af01dc79932dc9a0ab854b75a02d26ef22d5a3849995774b66c", "ja": "でもテーマを考えるなら……茜ちゃんのカワイイ\nところを、も～っと押し出した方がいいんじゃない？", "zh": "不过，要是考虑主题的话……是不是应该把小茜可爱的一面再更加突出一点呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9008_p", "source_sha256": "481b0076d4648f56c7132611662025b4a8a4a846238de1343a436d27c9f52f6e", "ja": "た、確かに……。\nもうちょっと工夫が必要ということか。それなら……。", "zh": "确、确实……  \n也就是说，还需要再多下点功夫吗？那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9009", "source_sha256": "08ce74ac8afc6dfc0b9bd9e44ddffa11adf65e8922ed1537d6157733718063c3", "ja": "盛りに盛った茜", "zh": "堆得满满的茜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9010", "source_sha256": "524c311964471b67aa0fa06795724dd52c59e85ab7a7014b7fc4c2733ed69f7c", "ja": "強メンタルな茜", "zh": "强韧心态的茜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9200_p", "source_sha256": "43a43cc9563f334a90b24ba44fca0d3a56510b4df28365b34b94248558ce2e37", "ja": "茜の可愛さは、まだまだこんなものじゃない！　いつも\n以上に……大げさなぐらい可愛さをアピールしよう！", "zh": "茜的可爱，可还远不止这种程度！比平时\n更加……夸张地去展现你的可爱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9201_023aka", "source_sha256": "f5f524fb942b618fe7ce7c98d319ffd5caac90c92a49a3849d5de2410286c8cf", "ja": "なんと！？　カワイイカワイイ茜ちゃんを、さらに\n盛っちゃおうなんて……すごくいいよ～！", "zh": "竟然！？居然还想把可爱可爱的小茜再加码一番……太棒啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9202_023aka", "source_sha256": "b01b5d1e7c4f3eb5de28d1f66444b04e20e1574a078693f45382b481e5562f9b", "ja": "そういうことなら任せて！　世界中が茜ちゃんの\nガチ恋勢で溢れ返るくらい、アピール頑張るね♪", "zh": "既然这样就交给我吧！我会努力展现魅力，直到全世界都挤满小茜的真爱粉为止♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9300_p", "source_sha256": "43a43cc9563f334a90b24ba44fca0d3a56510b4df28365b34b94248558ce2e37", "ja": "茜の可愛さは、まだまだこんなものじゃない！　いつも\n以上に……大げさなぐらい可愛さをアピールしよう！", "zh": "茜的可爱，可还远不止这种程度！比平时\n更加……夸张地去展现你的可爱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9301_023aka", "source_sha256": "6fdab940a5b52df6e36d7b71d4c261dc019527a7d376e9f0950ebfceec164c04", "ja": "ええっ！？　今の茜ちゃんよりも大げさに……！？\nこれ以上盛ったら、国が傾いちゃうけど大丈夫！？", "zh": "诶诶！？还要比刚才的小茜更加夸张……！？\n再继续加码的话，国家都要倾覆了，真的没问题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9302_023aka", "source_sha256": "ad7844bdbbfcfe3a9c1f8d8665ef5bd314f2b414cb238cef1ff1399c471cba6e", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。カワイさ\nマシマシの茜ちゃんにガチ恋しても知らないからね☆", "zh": "{$P$}……要是真的无可救药地迷上\n可爱加倍的小茜，我可不管哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9500_p", "source_sha256": "d3a726951a8b42b8851651e08e050856c1cda42bbb468e7dc8f444f93d6a4319", "ja": "メンタルつよつよな茜をイメージしてみよう。周りの\n目なんか一切気にしない最強の美少女になりきるんだ！", "zh": "想象一下心理素质超强的茜吧。扮演一个完全不在乎周围目光的最强美少女！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9501_023aka", "source_sha256": "63857d99cc3481a6b14848e8542b12b451ace5ec9689a1c8c669058153037029", "ja": "茜ちゃんが……最強の、美少女に！？\nちょっとイメージしてみるね。……むむむっ。", "zh": "小茜要变成……最强的美少女！？让我稍微想象一下。……唔唔唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9502_023aka", "source_sha256": "63c9fdb0d94ae8e98236993fc71fcd78a4bec28dc9c0a33d0350c91c6a137180", "ja": "見えた……唯一無二のカワイさで無双する茜ちゃんの姿\nが！　{$P$}ちゃん、撮影始めよう！", "zh": "看到了……凭借独一无二的可爱无敌无双的小茜身姿就在眼前！　{$P$}，我们开始拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9600_p", "source_sha256": "d3a726951a8b42b8851651e08e050856c1cda42bbb468e7dc8f444f93d6a4319", "ja": "メンタルつよつよな茜をイメージしてみよう。周りの\n目なんか一切気にしない最強の美少女になりきるんだ！", "zh": "想象一下心理素质超强的茜吧。扮演一个完全不在乎周围目光的最强美少女！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9601_023aka", "source_sha256": "6e9a0dbc459d0ed9e8a9b82d662f806bc405dad4fd84cde04a7273496c73bd57", "ja": "今でも十分つよつよなのに、更につよつよになれと！？\nでもテーマから離れちゃわない？", "zh": "明明现在已经很强了，还要我变得更强！？  \n不过，这样不会偏离主题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_9602_023aka", "source_sha256": "ac17841d6a17e78b6bbfc1ef62ca3bc0d8ffa900e559984bea3da01d11067453", "ja": "まあ、茜ちゃんが本気を出すには、まだ早いってこと\nかもね。ああ……！　カワイイって、ホント罪！", "zh": "也是呢，要让小茜拿出真本事，可能\n还为时尚早吧。啊啊……！可爱真的就是罪过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
